1
00:00:00,257 --> 00:00:02,154
AT TWO FORTY-ONE A.M.,

2
00:00:02,174 --> 00:00:03,092
THE LIFT STOPS

3
00:00:03,112 --> 00:00:04,656
AT FLOOR THIRTEEN.

4
00:00:04,876 --> 00:00:06,832
YOUR TOWER HAS TWELVE.

5
00:00:07,052 --> 00:00:08,369
YOU'RE THE GUARD.

6
00:00:08,589 --> 00:00:09,622
YOUR RULE:

7
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:11,041
WHEN THE DOORS OPEN,

8
00:00:11,061 --> 00:00:11,836
COUNT THE PEOPLE

9
00:00:11,856 --> 00:00:12,889
WHO GET OUT.

10
00:00:13,109 --> 00:00:14,767
WRITE IT IN YOUR LOG.

11
00:00:14,987 --> 00:00:16,872
NEVER COUNT WHO GOES IN.

12
00:00:17,092 --> 00:00:18,579
ONE STEPS OUT.

13
00:00:18,799 --> 00:00:19,944
THE ARRIVAL CAMERA

14
00:00:19,964 --> 00:00:21,665
SHOWS AN EMPTY CAR.

15
00:00:21,885 --> 00:00:23,088
YOU WRITE ONE.

16
00:00:23,308 --> 00:00:24,396
NEXT STOP,

17
00:00:24,416 --> 00:00:25,775
TWO STEP OUT.

18
00:00:25,995 --> 00:00:26,814
THE CAR IS

19
00:00:26,834 --> 00:00:27,994
EMPTY AGAIN.

20
00:00:28,214 --> 00:00:29,488
YOU WRITE TWO.

21
00:00:29,708 --> 00:00:30,883
THEN THREE.

22
00:00:31,103 --> 00:00:32,816
THE LOG WRITES ITSELF,

23
00:00:32,836 --> 00:00:34,182
IN YOUR HANDWRITING.

24
00:00:34,402 --> 00:00:35,447
YOUR PEN IS STILL

25
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:36,542
ON THE DESK.

26
00:00:36,762 --> 00:00:38,605
YOU CHECK THE FLOOR PLAN.

27
00:00:38,825 --> 00:00:39,473
THERE IS NO

28
00:00:39,493 --> 00:00:40,682
GUARD BOOTH.

29
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:45,148
THE CAMERA TURNS.

30
00:00:45,368 --> 00:00:46,186
YOUR DESK IS

31
00:00:46,206 --> 00:00:47,665
INSIDE THE LIFT.

32
00:00:47,885 --> 00:00:49,386
YOU WEREN'T WATCHING IT.

33
00:00:49,606 --> 00:00:51,179
IT WAS CARRYING YOU.

34
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:53,213
FOUR PEOPLE STEP OUT.

35
00:00:53,433 --> 00:00:54,351
THE NEXT SHIFT

36
00:00:54,371 --> 00:00:55,872
HAS ALREADY BEGUN.

37
00:00:56,092 --> 00:00:57,578
THE DISPLAY READS:

38
00:00:57,598 --> 00:00:59,840
FLOOR THIRTEEN.
